Description: Road tracks for TORCS (E-Track 2, Ole Road 1, E-Track 6)
 Tracks for TORCS 1.3.7: e-track-2, ole-road-1, e-track-6. They go into
 TORCS's tracks directory and appear in Configure Race. Install TORCS-
 Tracks to get all 29 extra tracks at once.
